<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Protection Paladins</span></h2>Due to the staggered release of raids in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1, your ideal pre-raid gear changes as time goes on. This guide provides three gear sets to match different release phases. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units uniform-width" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%;">
<div id="dsf67g4d-mop-phase-1-pre-bis">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-first-in-row="true" data-href="#mop-phase-1-pre-bis-pre-raid-opening-pre-bis" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.jpg");'></span>Pre-Raid Opening Pre-BiS</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#mop-phase-1-pre-bis-celestial-msv-release-pre-bis" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_axe_1h_pandaraid_d_01.jpg");'></span>Celestial MSV Release Pre-BiS</div></button>
<button data-first-in-row="false" data-href="#mop-phase-1-pre-bis-phase-1-pre-bis" role="tab" tabindex="-1">
<div>
<span class="icontiny" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_sword_1h_pandaraid_d_01.jpg");'></span>Phase 1 Pre-BIS</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-mop-phase-1-pre-bis-pre-raid-opening-pre-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list describes a set of items you can acquire before the release of Mogu'Shan Vaults, requiring absolutely no gear from raids or Celestial dungeons. It skips raid drops entirely and leans on BoEs and PvP gear where appropriate, as these offer a noticeable advantage over Heroic dungeon items and better reflect the priorities of serious raiders prepping for early progression, while also avoiding unrealistic item choices.<br/>
<br/>
