<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-mop-phase-1-pre-bis-phase-1-pre-bis" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This set of gear is considered optimal once HoF items can be acquired through Celestial dungeons. Since the ToeS Celestial items are not that interesting, this list serves as your Pre-BiS, both in this phase and once all content has been released. The sets intentionally do not include World Boss drops. If you get lucky and acquire an item from Galleon, these are typically a direct upgrade over any item listed in these sets and should be built around specifically. <br/>
