<img alt="Circle of Scaled Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_149.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of Scaled Fury</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is notable in that it drops ilvl-496 Tier 14 legs and gloves as well as various ilvl-483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your tier set if you get lucky, but even the PvP items can hold their own in PvE content.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90912/angerforged-stompers">
<img alt="Angerforged Stompers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Angerforged Stompers</span></a>, a decent early pair of boots. Very lucky players may even receive <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87771/reins-of-the-heavenly-onyx-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Heavenly Onyx Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentgodmount_black.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Heavenly Onyx Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c2" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Protection Paladins</span></h2>Reputation gear is very strong and we recommend pushing each faction to at least <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span> reputation. Going beyond that depends on your gear needs and personal preference. Since most reputation rewards cost <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> Valor, there’s a natural trade-off to consider, but this becomes less of an issue as the phase goes on and the Valor cap increases. Two exceptions worth noting: <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> offer an excellent ring at <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span> which is also an excellent option for <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/paladin/protection/tank-challenge-mode-talents-bis-tips">Challenge Modes</a>, and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> offer a strong necklace.<div data-inserted-ad-group="1" style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
